WEBVTT

00:18.060 --> 00:20.120
<i>This isn't fiction.</i>

00:20.460 --> 00:22.580
<i>They were really fighting for their lives.</i>

00:22.940 --> 00:27.050
<i>This isn't like the fights I've seen
 from the other side of a screen.</i>

00:27.610 --> 00:30.080
<i>Some of those who were here just hours ago</i>

00:30.500 --> 00:32.260
<i>are no longer with us.</i>

00:34.110 --> 00:35.750
<i>This is all my fault!</i>

00:36.210 --> 00:39.950
<i>This is the result of my choices.</i>

00:39.950 --> 00:41.490
I guess Ralf's on the move.

00:42.710 --> 00:45.030
Shinki, ready the lightning.

00:46.610 --> 00:51.400
Kobolds, get ready to go. 
Cover your eyes and ears.

00:55.530 --> 00:56.520
Thank goodness.

00:57.050 --> 00:58.040
They're retreating.

00:58.460 --> 00:59.480
Now!

01:10.910 --> 01:12.390
<i>This isn't a retreat.</i>

01:12.810 --> 01:13.840
<i>It's a withdrawal.</i>

01:17.790 --> 01:21.400
<i>The whole point of this battle 
was to get to safety</i>

01:21.400 --> 01:24.720
<i>while mitigating the attack from the 
extermination squad as best we could.</i>

01:28.440 --> 01:29.220
<i>But...</i>

01:33.280 --> 01:38.200
<b><i>Episode 12   After the Battle</i></b>

01:37.490 --> 01:38.530
They're here.

01:41.790 --> 01:43.930
Where are the captured adventurers?

01:43.930 --> 01:45.450
We left them behind.

01:45.450 --> 01:48.230
They'll figure things out once they wake up.

01:48.230 --> 01:51.910
The beastmaster will be
 handed over to an investigator.

01:54.260 --> 01:56.670
Looks like our numbers have suffered.

01:57.850 --> 02:00.510
Fourteen out of the pack perished.

02:00.510 --> 02:04.600
Eleven are gravely injured and were 
either dismembered or otherwise disfigured.

02:04.880 --> 02:09.090
The healers did everything they could, 
but restoration is apparently difficult.

02:11.220 --> 02:13.530
It's... It's all my fault!

02:14.860 --> 02:20.100
Our leader... sacrificed himself to save me!

02:23.080 --> 02:26.400
If I'd only moved faster...

02:29.090 --> 02:32.620
<i>You've just gotta do what you've gotta do.</i>

02:41.560 --> 02:43.430
You need to stop crying.

02:45.560 --> 02:47.900
It's rude to the fallen.

02:52.760 --> 02:54.770
This is all because of you to begin with!

02:55.250 --> 02:59.620
Yes. I'm the one who let 
these casualties happen.

02:59.620 --> 03:02.180
<i>Which means I can't leave room for regret.</i>

03:02.180 --> 03:06.610
So I won't let anyone disrespect
 their memory any more.

03:06.940 --> 03:12.210
So you won't let us mourn
 the parents and friends we've lost?!

03:12.750 --> 03:14.740
I didn't say not to mourn them.

03:14.740 --> 03:17.670
I told you to stop feeling
 sorry for yourselves.

03:18.240 --> 03:20.230
You think it should've been you?

03:20.870 --> 03:23.550
They're the ones who should've survived?

03:24.100 --> 03:27.870
That line of thinking is just selfish!

03:28.870 --> 03:32.030
Their ambition was this pack's future.

03:32.030 --> 03:36.430
They wanted those they risked 
their lives for to be able to smile.

03:36.430 --> 03:40.520
You need to live strong so as not
to spit in the face of that!

03:41.770 --> 03:43.980
If you want to resent me, go ahead.

03:44.740 --> 03:46.300
But I...

03:49.120 --> 03:52.000
I'm going to become strong like they were!

03:52.440 --> 03:56.450
I'm going to put my life on the 
line so you can all survive!

04:06.020 --> 04:08.800
<i>I should've realized this sooner.</i>

04:09.160 --> 04:12.300
<i>As soon as Shinki recognized 
me as his master,</i>

04:12.300 --> 04:15.520
<i>it fell on me to protect and lead the goblins.</i>

04:15.920 --> 04:18.570
<i>As soon as I invited the 
kobolds into Project Shiana,</i>

04:18.570 --> 04:20.770
<i>I was supposed to protect them.</i>

04:21.120 --> 04:23.780
<i>I've chosen the path of a ruler.</i>

04:24.260 --> 04:27.520
<i>It's been a thorny road 
with monsters as my subjects.</i>

04:28.050 --> 04:33.070
<i>But that's exactly why I can't
let their lives go to waste!</i>

04:33.560 --> 04:36.950
<i>I'm going to save the rest 
of the kobolds no matter what!</i>

04:40.000 --> 04:41.840
I'm going to get stronger, too!

04:42.230 --> 04:43.790
Little sister?

04:44.150 --> 04:46.760
I'm going to protect this pack
 with Lady Neema!

04:47.990 --> 04:48.960
You're right.

04:49.340 --> 04:52.390
Grieving won't bring any of them back.

04:52.390 --> 04:53.200
In which case...

04:53.770 --> 04:57.640
We need to make the best 
of the future they created for us!

04:57.990 --> 05:00.350
I'm the one who brought her in.

05:00.720 --> 05:03.890
If she'd have you direct 
your resentment at her,

05:03.890 --> 05:05.810
then I shall bear it with her.

05:11.870 --> 05:14.940
Young lady... No, Lady Neema.

05:15.420 --> 05:18.410
Please lead us to peace.

05:18.870 --> 05:20.740
The stars are still telling me...

05:21.720 --> 05:24.590
that you're our savior, Lady Neema.

05:25.770 --> 05:28.830
Are you sure you're okay with me?

05:28.830 --> 05:33.850
We've made it through countless hardships 
so far with the guidance of the stars.

05:34.780 --> 05:38.180
And they're telling us to follow you
 down the path you've chosen.

05:40.470 --> 05:44.480
But it might end up being a long, harsh road.

05:47.280 --> 05:49.520
As the Star-Reader, I believe in the stars...

05:52.180 --> 05:54.170
and Lady Neema!

05:56.410 --> 05:59.630
Are you all okay with this?

06:04.080 --> 06:05.910
I have no objections.

06:08.050 --> 06:12.980
As the leader of the healers, let me just 
say that healing magic is not all-powerful.

06:13.400 --> 06:16.250
All living things someday die.

06:16.250 --> 06:18.590
We are no exception.

06:18.590 --> 06:21.690
It also means that this was the 
time for those who perished.

06:22.160 --> 06:25.640
Die not as prey, but fighting in battle.

06:25.640 --> 06:28.160
That is the creed of our hunters.

06:28.740 --> 06:30.030
I think that's just fine.

06:30.680 --> 06:32.760
I agree.

06:32.760 --> 06:36.400
You're saying that you're going 
to carry on their will, aren't you?

06:43.350 --> 06:46.290
My lady, we will also help.

06:46.730 --> 06:49.800
Please continue to look after our pack.

06:50.260 --> 06:52.170
Please!

06:55.900 --> 06:57.080
E-Everyone...

07:01.310 --> 07:02.310
I will!

07:14.710 --> 07:18.290
<i>Afterward, we discussed
where to go from there.</i>

07:19.440 --> 07:23.060
<i>We decided to send the kobolds
 to Mount Leitimo</i>

07:23.060 --> 07:25.910
<i>on the border of Mieuxga Province
to the southwest.</i>

07:25.910 --> 07:30.630
<i>As for the fallen, we temporarily
entrusted them to the Guardian of the Forest.</i>

07:32.310 --> 07:35.340
Now then, we really need to get back.

07:36.540 --> 07:37.700
Lady Neema.

07:39.360 --> 07:42.620
My little sister wishes to stay with you.

07:43.210 --> 07:44.990
But she's still weak.

07:44.990 --> 07:46.370
She'll train on our journey,

07:46.370 --> 07:49.070
so would you be willing to 
summon her when you need her?

07:50.010 --> 07:54.480
<i>Did I just land myself
the best animal-eared maid ever?!</i>

07:54.480 --> 07:55.460
Here's your tea!

07:56.890 --> 07:59.960
Well, you see, I am a noble's daughter.

07:59.960 --> 08:02.770
You'll have to live among the humans,

08:02.770 --> 08:05.910
and you'll have to learn 
proper etiquette, too.

08:05.910 --> 08:07.850
If it's for you, Lady Neema...

08:07.850 --> 08:09.930
If it's for everyone, I'll do my best!

08:09.930 --> 08:10.770
<i>Heck yes!</i>

08:11.340 --> 08:15.570
I'd like to honor my sister's decision 
by acknowledging her maturity.

08:15.570 --> 08:18.340
Lady Neema, would you give her a name?

08:18.640 --> 08:20.810
Huh? Me?

08:21.160 --> 08:25.850
Mr. Hanley said that the leader of
 a pack was who named everyone.

08:25.850 --> 08:27.170
Usually, yes.

08:27.170 --> 08:29.310
But my little sister is a beastperson.

08:29.310 --> 08:32.360
She's not a monster, so she won't 
be bound to you by her name.

08:32.360 --> 08:35.090
Not to mention, it's a very 
blessed thing to encounter

08:35.090 --> 08:37.560
a master who you believe to be perfect.

08:41.180 --> 08:43.290
Please, Lady Neema!

08:44.110 --> 08:45.420
In that case...

08:45.420 --> 08:48.500
<i>She's a member of the Star Wolf Tribe.
I'll choose a name of a star...</i>

08:49.250 --> 08:50.630
Spica!

08:51.880 --> 08:54.670
Your name is Spica!

08:54.670 --> 08:57.770
<i>The star of spring that signifies 
the end of cruel winter.</i>

09:00.010 --> 09:00.980
Okay!

09:00.980 --> 09:04.070
<i>Good, good. I'm glad she likes it.</i>

09:07.350 --> 09:08.970
What's the matter?

09:10.420 --> 09:13.610
Those two also want you 
to name them, Lady Neema.

09:14.050 --> 09:15.310
Huh?

09:15.640 --> 09:19.030
<i>But kobolds would be bound 
to me by their names...</i>

09:19.590 --> 09:20.760
What should I do?

09:21.200 --> 09:24.370
Personally, I'd be grateful 
if you could name them.

09:24.810 --> 09:27.180
I'm curious to see how they'll grow up.

09:27.180 --> 09:29.210
<i>What are they, guinea pigs?!</i>

09:29.490 --> 09:32.160
Hmm, in that case...

09:32.460 --> 09:36.040
Gou, you'll be Seigo.
And Roku, you'll be Rikusei.

09:40.590 --> 09:42.090
H-Huh?

09:42.540 --> 09:44.100
The usual crest...

09:45.570 --> 09:48.070
There! It's under your fur!

09:51.100 --> 09:52.730
That tickles.

09:52.730 --> 09:53.490
Neema.

09:54.280 --> 09:56.860
We're heading back. We've heard from Ralf.

09:57.330 --> 09:59.840
The extermination squad is 
about to have their banquet.

10:00.580 --> 10:01.420
Okay.

10:06.350 --> 10:07.830
Thanks for everything.

10:07.830 --> 10:08.860
Take care.

10:09.210 --> 10:11.220
Be careful, everyone!

10:11.220 --> 10:14.850
We'll meet back up with all of you once 
we're done with what we need to do.

10:15.310 --> 10:16.640
Lady Neema!

10:17.730 --> 10:20.410
Spica, this is goodbye for a little while.

10:20.410 --> 10:22.550
Yeah! Just wait for me!

10:22.550 --> 10:24.880
Goodbye!

10:28.470 --> 10:30.480
<i>For sure, no matter what...</i>

10:31.130 --> 10:33.570
<i>let us meet again safe and sound!</i>

10:38.540 --> 10:40.570
We leave tomorrow at noon.

10:41.060 --> 10:42.600
We'll spend a night in Galea,

10:42.600 --> 10:45.280
then use transportation magic 
in Darshleigh to get to Fauxbe.

10:45.740 --> 10:49.340
However, this is all
 riding on Healran's report.

10:49.340 --> 10:51.240
Fear not.

10:51.600 --> 10:53.190
Healran!

10:53.190 --> 10:54.830
Thank goodness you're all right.

10:55.190 --> 10:56.310
You as well.

10:56.640 --> 10:59.000
I've brought the evidence we discussed.

11:03.840 --> 11:06.940
These are order and delivery receipts,
plus records of their usage.

11:07.210 --> 11:09.930
There were receipts
 for additional orders later,

11:09.930 --> 11:11.690
but I couldn't find the goods anywhere.

11:11.690 --> 11:14.650
There are also signs of tampering 
in the usage records.

11:14.980 --> 11:17.480
<i>So the invoices are made-up?</i>

11:17.480 --> 11:22.110
<i>Which means that the merchants 
and some of the knights are also involved.</i>

11:22.600 --> 11:26.400
Well done. We'll conduct an 
investigation based on this.

11:26.400 --> 11:29.080
I'll have the capital send agents at once.

11:30.270 --> 11:31.920
You won't catch them yourself, Will?

11:32.360 --> 11:35.130
In truth, I don't want to waste
 too much time here.

11:35.650 --> 11:38.890
Besides, there's probably more to all of this.

11:39.400 --> 11:42.550
We should be able to catch someone 
other than the commander, too.

11:42.550 --> 11:43.850
<i>Go figure...</i>

11:43.850 --> 11:45.490
I'd like to go over the details.

11:45.490 --> 11:46.340
Of course.

11:50.420 --> 11:52.210
Ralf!

11:52.620 --> 11:54.550
Neema, are you hurt at all?

11:55.400 --> 11:56.280
I'm fine!

11:56.630 --> 11:59.180
Sounds like you escaped 
casualties on your side.

11:59.180 --> 11:59.620
Yeah.

12:00.200 --> 12:03.020
Everyone's already gathered 
for the recognition banquet.

12:08.810 --> 12:11.400
So much yummy-looking stuff!

12:12.010 --> 12:16.730
Don't go wandering off alone now. 
Make sure you stay by me and Will.

12:16.730 --> 12:17.370
Of course!

12:17.750 --> 12:21.840
Well, well, Prince Wilhelt and Lord Ralfreed.

12:26.070 --> 12:29.770
I'm sure the knights will be 
overjoyed that you're here.

12:30.290 --> 12:32.580
I'm glad that the extermination 
was a success.

12:33.110 --> 12:36.000
Keep up the good work for our kingdom.

12:36.000 --> 12:37.490
<i>Yeah, that's definitely an act...</i>

12:37.930 --> 12:41.600
Thank you very much. If you'll excuse me...

12:44.120 --> 12:46.660
I want someone to keep an 
eye on him for a while.

12:46.660 --> 12:48.250
In that case...

12:48.250 --> 12:50.630
Shinki, will you do it?

12:51.100 --> 12:51.710
Sure.

12:52.040 --> 12:55.660
If he tries to run away or disobeys, 
you have permission to capture him!

12:55.980 --> 12:56.970
All right.

12:58.800 --> 13:02.880
Neema, I'm going to go heal some people, 
so make sure you stay with Will.

13:02.880 --> 13:03.600
Okay!

13:04.000 --> 13:07.550
In that case, I guess we can 
go talk to Red Hlaada.

13:08.700 --> 13:10.000
Red Hlaada?

13:10.380 --> 13:14.870
Yeah. We at least need to pay our respects.

13:25.780 --> 13:28.990
I heard that you performed 
magnificently during this mission.

13:29.510 --> 13:30.460
You have my thanks.

13:30.770 --> 13:33.410
Oh, no, there's no need to thank us.

13:33.760 --> 13:37.820
Hardly. It's because of you that 
casualties on our side were so low.

13:39.560 --> 13:40.830
<i>That sword...</i>

13:48.900 --> 13:50.470
Lars?

13:51.600 --> 13:55.860
<i>That's right. Right now, I'm supposed 
to act like the daughter of a duke.</i>

13:55.860 --> 13:57.480
<i>I need to get a grip.</i>

14:03.370 --> 14:05.220
I'm Luck of the Ice Bear Tribe.

14:06.490 --> 14:10.940
I'm honored to meet 
the great wind holy beast.

14:11.670 --> 14:13.990
<i>So he's a bear beastperson?</i>

14:18.870 --> 14:20.600
Smack!

14:21.790 --> 14:23.240
What's your name, miss?

14:23.890 --> 14:26.400
Ahem. Pardon me.

14:26.400 --> 14:29.250
I'm the second daughter of 
Dayland Osphe, Nefertima.

14:29.680 --> 14:32.300
Oh, so your dad's a duke.

14:32.300 --> 14:36.740
I'm not very good with human 
etiquette and fancy talk,

14:36.740 --> 14:38.590
so I apologize in advance.

14:38.880 --> 14:41.560
I know there's a difference in cultures.

14:44.340 --> 14:48.280
You're not the master of the 
wind holy beast, are you?

14:48.700 --> 14:50.980
That would be Will over there.

14:50.980 --> 14:52.490
It's such an honor to meet you!

14:53.640 --> 14:55.440
Lars and I...

14:56.650 --> 14:58.150
are friends!

14:58.150 --> 14:58.900
What?!

14:59.300 --> 15:02.010
The holy beast is your <i>friend</i>?!

15:02.010 --> 15:03.120
Right?

15:04.520 --> 15:06.790
You sure are strange.

15:06.790 --> 15:08.140
Well, whatever.

15:08.140 --> 15:12.310
Now that I've greeted the holy beast, 
I guess I'll go get some grub.

15:15.780 --> 15:17.020
You wanna tag along?

15:17.530 --> 15:18.710
Can I?!

15:18.710 --> 15:19.480
Sure.

15:20.660 --> 15:22.630
What should I eat first?

15:22.630 --> 15:27.070
Should I start with meat? 
But there's also fish...

15:29.240 --> 15:32.060
Is there something you 
want to eat, little lady?

15:39.120 --> 15:40.820
Oh, fine.

15:43.780 --> 15:47.120
Wow! I'm so high up! This is so fun!

15:47.120 --> 15:49.500
You sure are a brave little lady.

15:49.500 --> 15:50.740
I'm expecting a lot from you—

15:50.740 --> 15:54.670
Will! I'm gonna go get 
some food with Mr. Luck!

15:55.120 --> 15:58.330
Neema? What about your promise to Ralf?

15:58.330 --> 16:00.860
Then come with us, Will!

16:02.450 --> 16:04.990
Would you all come with me as well?

16:04.990 --> 16:07.330
Looks like she's gotten a bit attached.

16:07.330 --> 16:10.030
That's perfectly fine. 
Luck seems happy, too.

16:10.030 --> 16:11.870
Well, this is rare.

16:12.340 --> 16:15.950
Luck loves children, 
but kids are always so afraid of him.

16:19.910 --> 16:21.790
U-Um, Mr. Luck?

16:22.510 --> 16:25.380
May I touch your ears?

16:25.380 --> 16:26.750
Sure, why not?

16:31.840 --> 16:34.170
<i>Yes! This is what I've been waiting for!</i>

16:34.560 --> 16:37.760
<i>The bottom is thin but has 
a delightful fluffy feel!</i>

16:37.760 --> 16:40.010
<i>The top is firm and has a nice texture!</i>

16:40.010 --> 16:41.640
<i>Maximum healing!</i>

16:46.940 --> 16:47.980
What's the matter?

16:48.490 --> 16:50.270
Say, Mr. Luck...

16:51.380 --> 16:53.150
Belgar Crius.

16:54.930 --> 16:56.130
You!

16:56.760 --> 16:59.900
Wh-What do you want?
Don't get in the way of my work.

17:00.190 --> 17:01.990
I won't.

17:02.350 --> 17:05.400
O-Oh, okay...

17:05.400 --> 17:07.610
I can see you're working hard.

17:09.390 --> 17:12.420
All in order to survive.

17:12.800 --> 17:16.160
Nefertima, when I get stronger,
I'm gonna come rub it in your face!

17:16.630 --> 17:20.840
I'm gonna be as strong as my dad 
so that I can protect everyone!

17:21.330 --> 17:23.190
Don't forget our promise.

17:23.620 --> 17:25.320
You either, Belgar.

17:25.320 --> 17:27.400
I guess that makes us friends now.

17:27.730 --> 17:28.470
Wha—

17:29.480 --> 17:30.820
Belgar!

17:31.650 --> 17:35.100
Why are you out here playing? 
The dishes are piling up again!

17:35.530 --> 17:38.750
Y-Yes, sir! Sorry! I'll be right there!

17:41.140 --> 17:42.280
This one.

17:43.290 --> 17:44.390
Yes, sir!

17:51.250 --> 17:53.980
You're not very noble-like, little lady.

17:53.980 --> 17:56.920
Yeah, I get that a lot...

18:00.770 --> 18:02.430
Neema, sorry I'm la—

18:02.690 --> 18:03.860
Neema!

18:04.440 --> 18:05.930
Karna!

18:09.860 --> 18:12.450
Karna, please let Neema go.

18:12.450 --> 18:15.140
Oh, s-sorry!

18:16.980 --> 18:19.100
Neema, I missed you so much.

18:19.100 --> 18:22.820
Okay, now tell me all about 
what you've been doing without me.

18:23.180 --> 18:25.280
I'd love to, Karna!

18:30.540 --> 18:32.410
So yummy!

18:33.290 --> 18:34.100
Cheep.

18:34.460 --> 18:37.790
Nox, Gratia, Haku, do you all want seconds?

18:42.620 --> 18:43.510
Cheep.

18:43.970 --> 18:46.940
You really did form pacts with monsters...

18:46.940 --> 18:50.460
Neema, you truly are beloved 
by the God of Divine Creation.

18:50.460 --> 18:51.980
Beloved?

18:53.310 --> 18:56.450
Yeah, maybe I am. But...

18:59.430 --> 19:03.430
There's still so much I need 
to study because of that.

19:03.430 --> 19:04.520
Study?

19:05.610 --> 19:09.480
About countries and people... 
I basically need to study lots.

19:09.480 --> 19:13.750
Because now I know that my status
means I have lots of responsibilities.

19:14.140 --> 19:17.800
I don't want to burden my family 
just because I'm little.

19:17.800 --> 19:21.210
I want to live such that I don't 
bring shame upon on our name.

19:21.860 --> 19:22.920
Neema...

19:25.140 --> 19:28.360
You must've gone through something really big.

19:32.100 --> 19:33.070
Yeah.

19:34.430 --> 19:36.770
I don't really get what all this is about...

19:37.370 --> 19:40.790
but you can count on us if 
you're ever in any trouble.

19:40.790 --> 19:43.310
Though all I can do is fight.

19:44.320 --> 19:46.280
I will! Thank you.

19:48.030 --> 19:50.750
<i>Mr. Luck is a nice guy.</i>

19:51.070 --> 19:55.590
<i>Someday, I hope I can make people 
understand that there are some monsters</i>

19:55.590 --> 19:57.410
<i>you can actually talk to.</i>

19:57.980 --> 20:02.350
<i>I'm pretty sure that Mr. Luck and the 
Fighter Leader would've gotten along.</i>

20:02.350 --> 20:04.890
<i>He was a wonderful old man.</i>

20:14.860 --> 20:16.780
Neema. Neema.

20:17.350 --> 20:19.640
Wake up, Neema.

20:27.890 --> 20:29.180
Sol!

20:29.180 --> 20:30.670
What are you doing in Lenice?

20:30.670 --> 20:32.870
It's nothing urgent, but...

20:33.270 --> 20:34.340
Can you step out?

20:34.850 --> 20:35.590
Huh?

20:36.060 --> 20:40.890
I'd like to show you a bit of this world.

20:50.310 --> 20:52.810
Wow! It's so pretty!

20:53.130 --> 20:55.520
Let us head a little further north.

20:59.580 --> 21:02.820
This world is brimming with beautiful things.

21:03.760 --> 21:06.860
Humans are fools for not seeing it.

21:08.910 --> 21:10.820
Yeah, you're right.

21:11.540 --> 21:15.550
<i>Humans are foolish and weak, 
yet serious and pure.</i>

21:16.500 --> 21:19.340
<i>Other living things come in many forms,
and they're also</i>

21:19.340 --> 21:21.240
<i>just doing what they can to survive.</i>

21:22.150 --> 21:23.730
Say, Sol.

21:24.100 --> 21:26.650
I love this world.

21:26.650 --> 21:29.680
I love everyone and everything here.

21:29.680 --> 21:33.640
So I swear on my name as Nefertima Osphe

21:34.160 --> 21:37.350
I'm going to make Project Shiana a success.

21:37.970 --> 21:39.310
And...

21:39.310 --> 21:44.440
I'm going to make this a place where 
everyone can become one within this light.

21:56.330 --> 22:01.090
<b><i>Fluffy Paradise</i></b>

21:56.360 --> 21:58.680
<i>Someday, for sure!</i>

23:36.970 --> 23:39.970
<b>The End</b>
